w anything, and it comes alive.","kind":"line"},{"text":"Draw it. It comes alive. Then look after it.","kind":"line"},{"text":"All set. Let's draw something.","kind":"line"},{"text":"Fish breathe underwater using gills instead of a nose!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A starfish can grow a whole new arm if it loses one!","kind":"line"},{"text":"An octopus has three hearts and blue blood!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Crabs walk sideways because of the way their legs bend!","kind":"line"},{"text":"It's the daddy seahorse who carries the babies!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A sea turtle can hold its breath for hours underwater!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A shark can have thousands of teeth in its whole life!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A jellyfish has no brain, no bones, and no heart!","kind":"line"},{"text":"The blue whale is the biggest animal that has ever lived!","kind":"line"},{"text":"There are eight planets going around our Sun!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Mercury is the closest planet to the Sun — super hot!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Venus is the hottest planet, even hotter than Mercury!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Mars is called the Red Planet because its dirt is rusty!","kind":"line"},{"text":"The Moon has no wind, so footprints stay for a very long time!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Stars are giant balls of burning gas, far, far away!","kind":"line"},{"text":"The Sun is a star — our very own star!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A rocket has to go super fast to leave the Earth!","kind":"line"},{"text":"UFO just means a flying thing nobody can name yet!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Nobody has ever found a real alien… but space is very big!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Astronauts float because there's no gravity to hold them down!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A comet is a giant snowball flying through space!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Satellites help your phone know where you are!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A cow has four tummies to help it eat all that grass!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Pigs roll in mud to keep cool — they can't sweat much!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A chicken can remember more than a hundred faces!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A sheep's wool never stops growing, like your hair!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Horses can sleep standing up!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A duck's feathers are so oily that water rolls right off!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A tractor's back wheels are huge so it won't get stuck in mud!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A T-Rex had tiny arms but a bite stronger than a lion!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Triceratops had three horns to keep it safe!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Stegosaurus had a brain the size of a walnut!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Long-necks were so tall they could eat the treetops!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Pterodactyls flew, but they were not birds!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A volcano is a mountain that can puff out hot melted rock!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Every dinosaur once started inside an egg!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A coconut can float across the whole sea to grow a new tree!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A cat says hello by rubbing its head on you!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A dog smells the world a million times better than you do!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Some birds fly all the way around the world every year!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A butterfly tastes with its feet!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Bees do a little dance to tell each other where flowers are!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A frog drinks water through its skin — it never sips!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A snake smells the air with its wiggly tongue!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A big tree can drink hundreds of buckets of water in a day!","kind":"line"},{"text":"Flowers turn to follow the Sun across the sky!","kind":"line"},{"text":"A rainbow is sunlight bent by tiny raindrops!","kind":"line"}]}